{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_36_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_36","textTraditional":"一、七年，春，夫人姜氏會齊侯于防。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_36_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_36","textTraditional":"二、夏四月辛卯夜，恒星不見，夜中星霣如雨。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_36_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_36","textTraditional":"恒星者何？列星也。列星不見，則何以知？夜之中星反也。如雨者何？如雨者非雨也。非雨則曷為謂之如雨？不修春秋曰：「雨星不及地尺而復。」君子修之曰：「星霣如雨。」何以書？記異也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_36_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_36","textTraditional":"三、秋，大水。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_36_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_36","textTraditional":"四、無麥、苗。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_36_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_36","textTraditional":"無苗，則曷為先言無麥，而後言無苗？一災不書，待無麥然後書無苗。何以書？記災也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_36_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_36","textTraditional":"五、冬，夫人姜氏會齊侯于穀。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}